Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.06,0:00:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get you to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We landed on a boat that was adrift,\Nthen floated on over to this here island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been rescued, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tempted to put up my\Nbarrier, but I shan't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's my partner, so\NI'll take my medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay strong and brace for impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you send me flying, Pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're excited to see Boxo, but\Nyou've got to be more gentle with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he could get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I'm real sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to turn that\Nfrown upside-down stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you, you big lug.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, that smile's\Ngonna void my warranty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.10,0:01:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, that is a beautiful reunion gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I was pretty worried too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't I get a little something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be lame to give her\Nthe same gift I gave my llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.30,0:01:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll surprise and delight\Nwith shock and awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form, change, cancel machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're giving me a bunch of balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're tiny toy tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen some of these things\Nbefore, but they could come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use them as a reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pitti's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I deserve a gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fave clam likes sweet\Ntreats and flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.58,0:01:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something sweet. Oh, snap! Eureka!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A parfait keychain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.72,0:02:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japan is undefeated in the world\Nof plastic food, tchotchkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.22,0:02:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mission successful! Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Boxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,am I imagining things or have you and Pity\Ngotten a lot cozier since I last saw you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even try to deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you are definitely\Ntoo close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not gonna lie, she's a big Boxo fan\Nafter all the time we spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like a big metal brother or\Neven just a beloved magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back me up, Pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo and I are quite close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sleep together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,share our meals, and even\Nuse the restroom together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not wrong, but a little\Ntact would have gone a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner, Lamas.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.37,0:03:13.79,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel my burnt one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel my grit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel my grit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel my grit. I feel my grit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel my grit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eina Bernard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultra. Your arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you from the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe you in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoyed it.\NI hope you enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to recover!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.51,0:03:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I know you will do\Nit... I will live him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:04:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.03,0:04:26.99,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(358,1)\fscx92\pos(337,55)}The Troubles Will Continue Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know of a base on a small island behind\Nthe Stratum Lord they call Dog Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I firmly believe it will significantly\Ndelay the Netherlord's plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's in a difficult location.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Dog Mountain moves, we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to be a vibe killer, but we already\Nhave the Demon Lord hot on our trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the big pooch piles\Non, we're as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, which is why I already\Nsent a hunter to scout out the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until he returns here with a report, I\Nencourage you to take this time to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, may I borrow Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, if it's okay with him. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then please carry him to the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Pity, could you,\NHeavy, and Shui join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From your perspectives, what are the chances\Nthose wayward souls will return to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain and his menagerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had the pleasure of training the\Ncaptain myself on several occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm a bit concerned\Nabout having him as an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just come out\Nand say it, you old coot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a parent yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,part of you finds it difficult\Nto blame them for their actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems our little\Nsurvey was pretty legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there was a way to\Nlift the curse on his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain he wouldn't\Nhesitate to turn his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they're trapped\Nin a no-win scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need Sulreem's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, you need to know, she likes the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, really likes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to scar him for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks for the intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:05:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ix aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at least his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't seem to be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Ix is pretty thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to get him out of that wax sitch,\Nbut alas, I'm merely a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do owe him for helping\Nus escape, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who\Nalways pays his debts, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work with the recon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I made it inside the base,\Nbut there was no sign of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were no boats docked either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The place appeared to be deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thoughts, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only speculate, but it's concerning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord may have\Nordered those who escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by boat to rile up the\NDog Mountain Stratumlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would completely wipe out all\Ntraces of evidence as well as the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stratum would be doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the time being, we'll\Ndo more reconnaissance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dog Mountain Stratum\NLord is on its way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instruct all the inhabitants to\Ntransfer to Clearflow Lake Stratum!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a mighty big wave,\Nbig enough to do us all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, we're evacuating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The women and children take priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.42,0:07:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tiny director can handle\Ngetting everyone out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for us, we gotta stop\Nthat dangerous Decay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way it's emerging\Nfrom the water is like
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could call it Dogzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling confident we\Ncan beat a whole mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you guys do to fight back\Nthe last time this thing attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember Grams?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it really seems like\NGrams here is going senile on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wound up in the thing's belly, then\Nwent completely ballistic on its insides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a close fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We barely won.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, so you've beaten it before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but I was essentially\Na cub when we did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we only narrowly secured victory\Nby hacking away at its innards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I was there,\Nit still seems nuts to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were almost doggy kibble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it once, so\Nwe'll just do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's treacherous in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its stomach is filled with burning\Ngastric acid for digestion,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the average person would\Ndissolve in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in the day, we only dared to\Nchallenge it after months of preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I vote for not burning\Nto death in a pup's tum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, our only\Noption is to get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity and Voxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll attack from up\Nin the sky. Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's useful, feel free to use the\Nmagic items I made that can freeze water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to fly. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure to come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.91,0:09:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hold off on fixing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judge me not, but the damage\Nmakes me feel closer to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, go time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go the Hulemy route.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your thing, magic items!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bought us a teensy bit of\Ntime, but it won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:09:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she may like some\Nof the nice juicy wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take me some of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We showed the big dog who the big dog is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now we got a scurry for our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't be long before it\Nstarts rampaging again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we got everyone out before\Nthis place is swallowed by waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for having my own stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll miss my unelected position of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The directors figured out\Nhousing for all the evacuees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wanted to do my part, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I decided to welcome the\Nnewcomers with a generous flash sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To ease the sting of losing their\Nhomes, they get a 90 % discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doling out freebies to folks who\Nonly brought the clothes on their backs.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.34,0:11:00.97,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H9D7932&\bord0\shad0\move(370,40,370,90)\fs23}Family Market
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any vending machine worth its salt\Nwould choose kindness over profits.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.97,0:11:04.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(495,181)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Clearflow Lake Stratum's kinda peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already have food and\Nshelter pretty much on lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though there was a\Nshort-lived fashion emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then we held the\NDungeon Goddess Grand Prix,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awakening everyone's inner fashionista.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This heralded the start of a\Nstratum-wide fashion craze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everyone's Gouda on food,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clothing and shelter But what's\Nlife without some jollies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the local men of culture\NWere not so patiently
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awaiting the reopening of a certain shop
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shirley recruited yours truly\Nto draw in new customers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, cutie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling thirsty,\Nwhy not come inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the sody, Bob!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, our new friend,\Nladies. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep up the great work, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:11:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a vending machine can\Nresist those feminine wiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm a one-woman appliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Rosie and me, the dog\Nfiend, is going to love these gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be surprised how\Nmany people attempt to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,buy the affections of\Nthese ladies of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sage-advice and unique range\Nof products are hot commodities,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm essentially the village wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo. G-Oarch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me out. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Gorth is in the mood for some lovin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, um, yeah, I was wondering if you had\Nthoughts on what Miss Shirley would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna woo Miss Shirley?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow your roll, Icarus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're flying way too close to the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're talking lunatic mode with no saves,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hopeless quest in a romantic\Nhell of your own making.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really want to please her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know she likes cash payments.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outside of that, I actually\Ndon't know a whole lot about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can check back in later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the same metal box who\Nhelped Karios find love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The completionist in me would love to\Ncouple up his partner Gorth as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of love, I'll find out what\Nkind of non-dirty stuff Miss Shirley likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I was going to need\Nbackup, so I enlisted Lamas,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy, and Suco to help dig up the deets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really close enough to\NMiss Shirley's house? Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clue one acquired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She works in an extravagant den of sin,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but lives in a house\Nthat's pretty run-of-mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to go and have a look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holler if you see someone coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better go incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be bad if Miss\NShirley recognized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:13:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they got their\Ngarb from Sus R Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're just going\Nfor a nice little stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, so much for the\Nbenefit of the doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops. Oh, cool. You talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go scare him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Total overkill!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't disturb the peace\Nthis early in the a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How very odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I heard\Na rabid animal screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suppose it was a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just as alluring at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Shirley looks good in a dress, but\Nshe's a real smoke show in that red vinyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a naughty version of my outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helps that you don't have\Nbare skin or honkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's supposed to have the whole day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder where she's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I honestly can't imagine\Nhow she spends her time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first thought was a fancy lunch at\Nsome pricey restaurant or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not exactly dressed for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.74,0:15:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Miss Shirley?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that place the local orphanage?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know because Shui and I\Npaid them a visit recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us glutton swing by sometimes\Nto play with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.28,0:15:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think she came to cheer them up about\Nthe whole not having parents thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray! It's Miss Shirley!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which game do you want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a game you fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you throw it or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll play in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to have a word\Nwith the director first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I'll throw\Nthe ball or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:15:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hot dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, director!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Shirley says she\Nneeds to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could hear her very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Shirley, it's always\Na pleasure to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see the children so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the usual amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.60,0:16:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never thank you enough\Nfor all your generous donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out, she's\Nliterally helping orphans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brain's remembering something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui said Miss Shirley's\Nalso in the No Parents Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turns out Miss Shirley's\Nkind of an incredible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a prime example of womankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were a human male, I'd\Nkill to take her out to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd even spring for dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Gorth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's the major leagues, he's\Nstill playing t-ball in the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like an ancient\Ngoddess princess angel you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't have unless you\Nslay a dragon blindfolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel like maybe it\Nwas wrong of us to stalk her all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:17:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's apologize and play with the kids\Nto prove we're not terrible people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll play Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bear even though I'm not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna run out of chairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.61,0:17:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come play with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you get tired of tailing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for stalking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got carried away wanting\Nto know more about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We let Curiosity get the best of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't be mad. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you'd like to make amends, stick\Naround and spend some time with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.54,0:17:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bear time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of you wants\Nto be the bear first?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.49,0:17:40.49,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H333FDF&\3c&HEAEAE2&\bord4\shad0\fs30}Ice
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.62,0:17:42.49,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\bord0\c&HFFF7EA&\move(0,295,75,295)\fs12}Milk
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.00,0:17:51.00,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(515,60)\fs11\c&H9F814C&\bord0\shad0\}Family Market
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It warms the circuitry I call a\Nheart to see the joy on their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to come see us anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to keep prying, but is this\Nalways how you spend your off days?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I never really thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't enjoy shopping very much,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm constantly bringing\Ndelicious leftovers home from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very rarely indulge in dining out. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She spends her nights in a\Ndazzling world of excess,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but is not wasteful or indulgent herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's pretty, friendly, nice\Nto kids, and open-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Shirley's in the\Nrunning for best girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, did you figure anything out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.48,0:18:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to watch something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let them get away with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figured that would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let him handle the\Ncreepy trench coat brigade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems she's even more\Nwonderful than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd never fall for a guy like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a shoe loving a sock. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickest forfeit ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just have to be content with\Nwatching her thrive from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to stir up trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a surprisingly\Ndepressing turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.84,0:19:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the choice he's making.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the customer is always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been helping Miss Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get things rolling at her shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For about a week now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But today's the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back and see us soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a wonderful night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.22,0:20:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that there's something\NI can't get off my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have time, I'd\Nlove to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A neighbor told me there's been a lot\Nof suspicious activity around my house,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,particularly some interesting\Ncharacters being kind of pervy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup, them's the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've even had my underwear stolen\Nwhile it was hanging out to dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that sort of thing\Nhasn't been happening lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those pervy men are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great, but strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in the dark about\NGorth's white knighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, speaking of...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo, did I make it in\Ntime? Too bad! That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to have a\Ndrink before heading home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love a nightcap if\Nyou don't mind. Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:20:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the best idea I've heard in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I've hardly had a\Ndrop to drink today. It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're easily one of my\Nbest customers. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chill out, my guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to a hard day's work. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be difficult to\Nwork such late hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you know how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could vend love, I'd do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the best I can do is late-night booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I'll be rooting for these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.54,0:21:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a crying shame you can't\Nenjoy a cold beverage with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'd be thrilled to\Nshare a midnight drink with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ixnay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm tall, dark, and well-stocked,\NBut now is so not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:21:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.49,0:22:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If looks could kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be in the great factory\Nin the sky about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bota
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.87,0:22:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mustady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.17,0:23:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a story for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you, I'm waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.34,0:23:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you, I'm feeling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.50,0:23:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not funny. I know you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.98,0:23:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not good at all. I'm not good at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs20\fsp0\pos(468.2,294.8)}Another Uproar
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.20,0:23:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

